33
00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.410
Yucky!

34
00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.570
Well, I just saved our lives. Yeah. You're welcome.

35
00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.140
Riley, if you don't eat your dinner,

36
00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.520
