43
00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.630
Riley, Riley, here comes an airplane!

44
00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.190
Airplane. We got an airplane, everybody.

45
00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.790
Airplane.

46
00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.110
And you've met sadness. She... well, she...

47
00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.980
