224
00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.090
Wait, what? What happened?

225
00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.760
- A core memory!  - No!

226
00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.040
Sadness, what are you doing?

227
00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.460
It looked like one was crooked,

228
00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.500
so I opened it and then it fell out. I...

229
