It's just that... I wanted to maybe hold one.

230
00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.480
- Joy!

231
00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.560
Sadness, you nearly touched a core memory.

232
00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.060
