250
00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.570
My favorite?

251
00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.610
Well, I like it when we're outside.

252
00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.450
That's good. Like there's the beach and sunshine.

253
00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:14.540
Like that time we buried dad in the sand up to his neck.

254
00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.130
