01:14:21.420 --> 01:14:24.240
Riley? Riley!

1298
01:14:28.510 --> 01:14:30.030
I'll call her cell.

1299
01:14:34.010 --> 01:14:35.950
This is terrible. Wait, is that someone walking towards us?

1300
01:14:35.970 --> 01:14:37.240
Yep, let's cross the street.

1301
01:14:42.020 --> 01:14:43.490
It's mom. She's onto us!

1302
01:14:43.520 --> 01:14:44.860
- What do we do?  - Where's my bag?

1303
01:14:44.860 --> 01:14:46.400
Riley needs to get Core Memories.

1304
01:14:46.400 --> 01:14:48.040
- That's the stuff.  - We keep going.

1305
01:14:50.950 --> 01:14:52.600
Sadness!

1306
01:15:03.040 --> 01:15:05.170
Sadness! Sadness?

1307
01:15:05.210 --> 01:15:07.680
Come on, Sadness. Where are you?

1308
01:15:07.710 --> 01:15:10.260
Okay. If I were Sadness, where would I be?

1309
01:15:11.930 --> 01:15:15.600
Everything is awful and my legs don't work,

1310
01:15:15.600 --> 01:15:18.990
and you have to drag me around while I touch all the...

1311
01:15:34.280 --> 01:15:36.000
Oh, no! It's mom again! What do we do?

1312
01:15:43.420 --> 01:15:45.420
This is madness! She shouldn't run away!

1313
01:15:45.420 --> 01:15:46.970
Let's get this idea out of her head.

1314
01:15:47.920 --> 01:15:49.090
Sadness?

1315
01:15:51.260 --> 01:15:53.810
- Sadness!  - Joy?

1316
01:15:54.550 --> 01:15:55.470
Wait! Sadness!

1317
01:15:56.140 --> 01:16:00.200
Just let me go! Riley's better off without me!

1318
01:16:00.220 --> 01:16:01.270
Come back!

1319
01:16:06.560 --> 01:16:10.200
Okay, you're saying your husband was blown away by an elephant.

1320
01:16:10.230 --> 01:16:11.320
Was he with anyone?

1321
01:16:11.360 --> 01:16:12.780
Yes! And there she is!

1322
01:16:12.780 --> 01:16:14.250
Hey! Come back here!

1323
01:16:14.280 --> 01:16:16.490
Forget it, Jake. It's Cloud Town.

1324
01:16:20.290 --> 01:16:21.800
What? Sadness!

1325
01:16:22.700 --> 01:16:25.210
I only make everything worse!

1326
01:16:25.250 --> 01:16:27.520
Wait! Sadness! We got to get you back to...

1327
01:16:37.640 --> 01:16:39.240
- It's stuck!  - Great.

1328
01:16:39.260 --> 01:16:41.560
- What do you mean it's stuck?  - Now what?

1329
01:16:41.600 --> 01:16:43.280
Oh, no no no no! What is this?

1330
01:16:52.320 --> 01:16:53.860
- How do we stop it?  - I got it!

1331
01:16:53.860 --> 01:16:55.620
Make her feel scared! That'll make her change her mind!

1332
01:16:55.650 --> 01:16:57.740
- Brilliant!  - I know it's brilliant! Do it!

1333
01:16:57.780 --> 01:16:59.870
Nothing's working! Why isn't it working?

1334
01:16:59.870 --> 01:17:00.420
- Let me try.  - Great! You broke it!

1335
01:17:00.490 --> 01:17:01.580
- No, I didn't!  - Don't touch that!

1336
01:17:01.660 --> 01:17:02.870
- Let me do it!  - Get out of here!

1337
01:17:07.500 --> 01:17:10.970
Guys, we can't make Riley feel anything.

1338
01:17:11.840 --> 01:17:13.560
What have we done?

1339
01:17:14.340 --> 01:17:17.470
Hey! Hey, look at me! Did you mean what you said before?

1340
01:17:17.510 --> 01:17:19.930
I would die for Riley! I would die for Riley!

1341
01:17:19.970 --> 01:17:21.680
Yeah, okay, haircut. Time to prove it.

1342
01:17:25.520 --> 01:17:27.410
I would die for Riley! I would die for Riley!

1343
01:17:27.440 --> 01:17:30.040
I would die for Riley!

1344
01:17:45.700 --> 01:17:47.330
That's it! I fold!

1345
01:18:18.320 --> 01:18:22.500
This is crazy. This is crazy. No, no, no. Joy. Be positive.

1346
01:18:26.200 --> 01:18:28.170
I am positive this is crazy!

1347
01:18:32.040 --> 01:18:34.970
- Now!  - For Riley!

1348
01:18:42.260 --> 01:18:44.480
- Joy?  - Hang on!

1349
01:18:45.600 --> 01:18:47.820
I wish Joy was here!

1350
01:18:54.980 --> 01:18:56.400
It's Joy!

1351
01:18:57.280 --> 01:18:58.540
Stand back!

1352
01:18:59.700 --> 01:19:00.580
That worked.

1353
01:19:00.610 --> 01:19:02.240
Well, what would you do, if you're so smart?

1354
01:19:03.120 --> 01:19:05.920
I'd tell you, but you're too dumb to understand.

1355
01:19:05.950 --> 01:19:06.910
What?

1356
01:19:06.950 --> 01:19:08.750
Of course your tiny brain is confused.

1357
01:19:08.790 --> 01:19:11.660
Guess I'll just have to dumb it down to your level.

1358
01:19:11.670 --> 01:19:16.020
Sorry I don't speak moron as well as you, but let me try. Duh!

1359
01:19:25.640 --> 01:19:26.970
Thank Goodness you're back!

1360
01:19:26.970 --> 01:19:28.970
- Things are really messed up!  - We found this idea.

1361
01:19:28.970 --> 01:19:30.900
We were just trying to make happy memories.

1362
01:19:40.900 --> 01:19:42.450
Joy, you got to fix this! Get up there!

1363
01:19:42.490 --> 01:19:44.210
Sadness, it's up to you.

1364
01:19:44.240 --> 01:19:46.540
- Me?  - Sadness?

1365
01:19:46.580 --> 01:19:47.800
I can't, Joy.

1366
01:19:47.830 --> 01:19:50.470
Yes, you can. Riley needs you.

1367
01:20:02.340 --> 01:20:03.550
Okay.

1368
01:20:24.150 --> 01:20:26.830
Wait! Stop! I want to get off!

1369
01:20:38.420 --> 01:20:40.140
All right. Thank you. We will.

1370
01:20:40.170 --> 01:20:41.760
Her teacher hasn't even seen Riley all day.

1371
01:20:41.840 --> 01:20:42.770
- What?  - What was she wearing last?

1372
01:20:43.050 --> 01:20:44.480
- Do you even remember what...  - I can't believe this.

1373
01:20:46.010 --> 01:20:47.850
Riley, there you are! Thank Goodness!

1374
01:20:47.890 --> 01:20:50.320
We were worried sick! Where have you been? It's so late!

1375
01:22:22.270 --> 01:22:25.490
I know you don't want me to but...

1376
01:22:26.820 --> 01:22:28.210
I miss home.

1377
01:22:30.030 --> 01:22:31.700
I miss Minnesota.

1378
01:22:35.080 --> 01:22:38.340
You need me to be happy, but...

1379
01:22:40.040 --> 01:22:44.470
I want my old friends, and my hockey team.

1380
01:22:46.590 --> 01:22:48.400
I want to go home.

1381
01:22:50.430 --> 01:22:52.270
Please don't be mad.

1382
01:22:55.850 --> 01:22:57.990
- Sweetie.  - We're not mad.

1383
01:22:59.520 --> 01:23:03.080
You know what? I miss Minnesota too.

1384
01:23:04.730 --> 01:23:07.360
I miss the woods where we took hikes.

1385
01:23:08.280 --> 01:23:10.710
And the backyard where you used to play.

1386
01:23:11.530 --> 01:23:14.370
Spring Lake, where you learned to skate.

1387
01:23:16.540 --> 01:23:17.760
Come here.

1388
01:24:38.950 --> 01:24:40.660
Hey, I'm liking this new view.

1389
01:24:40.700 --> 01:24:42.210
Friendship Island has expanded.

1390
01:24:42.250 --> 01:24:44.890
Glad they finally opened that friendly argument section.

1391
01:24:44.920 --> 01:24:47.180
I like Tragic Vampire Romance Island.

1392
01:24:47.210 --> 01:24:49.890
Fashion Island? Everyone shut up.

1393
01:24:49.920 --> 01:24:52.220
Boy Band Island? Hope that's just a phase.

1394
01:24:52.260 --> 01:24:56.010
Say what you want, I think it's all beautiful.

1395
01:24:56.010 --> 01:24:57.600
All right. Here you go.

1396
01:24:57.640 --> 01:25:00.280
Your new expanded console is up and runnin'.

1397
01:25:02.140 --> 01:25:03.810
Cool! Upgrade!

1398
01:25:03.810 --> 01:25:05.910
Hey! Whoops, wait. Did I just do that?

1399
01:25:07.310 --> 01:25:08.780
Hey, guys? What's pub-er-ty?

1400
01:25:08.810 --> 01:25:11.070
I don't know. It's probably not important.

1401
01:25:11.110 --> 01:25:14.820
I have access to the entire curse word library!

1402
01:25:14.820 --> 01:25:17.030
This new console is the...

1403
01:25:18.030 --> 01:25:19.620
Sorry. I did it again. My bad.

1404
01:25:19.660 --> 01:25:20.710
They're getting to the rink.

1405
01:25:22.660 --> 01:25:24.380
Now when you get out there, you be aggressive!

1406
01:25:24.410 --> 01:25:26.130
- I know, dad.  - But not too aggressive.

1407
01:25:26.170 --> 01:25:28.970
You know, you guys don't have to come to every game.

1408
01:25:29.000 --> 01:25:32.040
Are you kidding? I'm not missing one! Go Foghorns!

1409
01:25:32.050 --> 01:25:36.610
- Go Riley! Foghorns are the best!  - Okay! I got to go!

1410
01:25:36.630 --> 01:25:37.930
They love us.

1411
01:25:37.970 --> 01:25:39.610
Yeah, mom and dad are pretty cool.

1412
01:25:39.640 --> 01:25:42.150
Guys, of course they are. But we can't show it.

1413
01:25:44.350 --> 01:25:45.980
She loved the face painting!

1414
01:25:46.020 --> 01:25:47.070
Told you it was a great idea!

1415
01:25:48.270 --> 01:25:51.570
- Best idea he's had in a while.  - He's a really good guy.

1416
01:25:56.320 --> 01:25:57.580
Just in case.

1417
01:26:00.620 --> 01:26:01.670
Sorry.

1418
01:26:04.580 --> 01:26:08.760
Girl! Girl! Girl!

1419
01:26:11.380 --> 01:26:14.270
Okay. Bye.

1420
01:26:18.260 --> 01:26:21.070
- Go, Riley!  - You got this!

1421
01:26:23.060 --> 01:26:25.220
- You ready?  - Yeah.

1422
01:26:25.220 --> 01:26:27.440
All right. Let's play some hockey!

1423
01:26:28.940 --> 01:26:29.990
All right, Anger, take it!

1424
01:26:30.020 --> 01:26:31.230
Give us that puck or you're dead meat!

1425
01:26:31.230 --> 01:26:32.280
On our left. On our left!

1426
01:26:32.310 --> 01:26:34.110
Let's just try not to get all smelly this time.

1427
01:26:34.150 --> 01:26:36.280
Mom and dad are watching us fail.

1428
01:26:36.320 --> 01:26:37.790
Not for long!

1429
01:26:39.110 --> 01:26:41.160
We've been through a lot lately, that's for sure.

1430
01:26:41.200 --> 01:26:43.210
But we still love our girl.

1431
01:26:43.240 --> 01:26:45.870
She has great new friends, a great new house.

1432
01:26:45.910 --> 01:26:47.380
Things couldn't be better.

1433
01:26:47.410 --> 01:26:51.750
After all, Riley's twelve now. What could happen?

1434
01:27:12.270 --> 01:27:15.610
And who can tell me what year San Francisco was founded?

1435
01:27:15.610 --> 01:27:17.670
Anyone? Jordan?

1436
01:27:20.320 --> 01:27:21.650
How much more of this?

1437
01:27:21.660 --> 01:27:25.340
Five months, two weeks and four days until Summer Vacation.

1438
01:27:25.370 --> 01:27:29.050
Then it's off to the Bahamas with you know who!

1439
01:27:29.080 --> 01:27:32.090
Come fly with me, Gatinha.

1440
01:27:35.790 --> 01:27:37.470
Have a nice day.

1441
01:27:38.460 --> 01:27:39.720
What are we mad about?

1442
01:27:39.760 --> 01:27:41.670
I don't know. Whatever Troy's mad about.

1443
01:27:41.680 --> 01:27:44.440
- What's Troy mad about?  - I don't know.

1444
01:27:45.140 --> 01:27:46.570
I know. Totally.

1445
01:27:47.470 --> 01:27:50.060
We're a total fraud! Do you think they can see through us?

1446
01:27:50.100 --> 01:27:51.980
Of course not! We're wearing eye shadow!

1447
01:27:51.980 --> 01:27:54.240
Being cool is so exhausting.

1448
01:27:54.770 --> 01:27:59.860
Who's the birthday girl? Hey! Hello?

1449
01:28:01.570 --> 01:28:05.410
Six years of drama school for this?

1450
01:28:05.450 --> 01:28:06.920
Move it, will you?

1451
01:28:09.580 --> 01:28:11.470
What are you doing? Come on!

1452
01:28:11.500 --> 01:28:13.210
You know what? This is okay. This is fine.

1453
01:28:13.210 --> 01:28:15.540
We just need to go to our happy place.

1454
01:28:15.540 --> 01:28:16.710
Tripledent Gum...

1455
01:28:16.710 --> 01:28:18.380
No! Not this again!
